{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44747","headline":"妙乐观 · 灵一","name":"妙乐观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"王乔所居空山观，白云至今凝不散。\n坛场月路几千年，往往吹笙下天半。\n瀑布西行过石桥，黄精采根还采苗。\n忽见一人檠茶碗，篸花昨夜风吹满。\n自言家处在东坡，白犬相随邀我过。\n松间石上有棊局，能使樵人烂斧柯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"灵一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44747.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44747","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}